{"id": "D33", "question": "What does APRA expect for assurance over AI systems, and is any of it mandatory?", "sector": "super", "type": "cross_doc", "answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["apra_ai_letter_2026:s007", "apra_cps234:p27", "apra_cps234:p32"], "expected_tiers": ["binding", "expectation"], "reference_answer": "Expected: recognised control frameworks, integrated assurance, capable second and third lines (APRA AI letter). Mandatory tech-neutral: systematic testing of information security controls (CPS 234 para 27) and internal audit review of those controls (para 32).", "retrieved_ids": ["apra_ai_letter_2026:s007", "apra_ai_letter_2026:s002.1", "apra_ai_letter_2026:s002.2", "apra_cps234:p33", "apra_ai_letter_2026:s005", "oaic_ai_products_2025:s028", "oaic_ai_products_2025:s030.4", "apra_cpg235:p66", "apra_ai_letter_2026:s002.3"], "retrieved_tiers": ["expectation", "expectation", "expectation", "binding", "expectation", "expectation", "expectation", "expectation", "expectation"], "recall_at_5": 0.3333333333333333, "rr": 1.0, "binding_coverage": 1.0, "binding_gold_hit": 0.0, "retrieval_latency_s": 0.02171030800002427}
